Hello World!

## 🧬 Conway's Game of Life

An interactive terminal simulation of [Conway's Game of Life](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conway%27s_Game_of_Life) — a zero-player cellular automaton where complex patterns emerge from simple rules.

### Rules
1. A live cell with 2 or 3 neighbours survives.
2. A dead cell with exactly 3 neighbours becomes alive.
3. All other cells die or stay dead.

### Run it

```bash
chmod +x game-of-life.sh
./game-of-life.sh            # default 20×40 grid
./game-of-life.sh 30 60 0.1  # custom: rows cols delay(s)
```

Press **Ctrl-C** to stop.

### Requirements
- Bash 3.2+ (macOS / Linux — no extra dependencies)
